# hello_server manifest — Uros #216 v2.1 pilot.
#
# hello_server is the canonical test/demo server: it allocates a
# receive port, registers via netname, runs a Mach message loop.
# It never calls cap_request / cap_acquire, so the legitimate cap
# set is empty.  A non-empty cap_acquire from this task means
# something broke or a test is trying to probe denial — both should
# come back as CAP_ERR_NOT_IN_MANIFEST under v2.1 enforcement.

name hello_server

# No `required` lines — empty caps_required.
# No `delegatable` lines — empty caps_delegatable.
